Notice here.","privacy-policy.html\u002F\u002Fwww.evri.com\u002Fprivacy-policy",{"link_type":12},"Document",{"link_type":12},[15,193,232,248,261,269,281,415,537,570,583,593,601,613,621,632,775,920,1082,1122],{"variation":16,"version":17,"items":18,"primary":20,"id":190,"slice_type":191,"slice_label":192},"default-slice","sktwi1xtmkfgx8626",[19],{},{"content":21},[22,27,31,34,37,40,44,47,50,53,56,59,63,66,69,72,75,88,91,93,96,99,108,114,117,119,122,125,127,130,134,137,143,148,153,158,162,166,171,176,182,184,187],{"type":23,"text":24,"spans":25,"direction":26},"heading1","Privacy Notice",[],"ltr",{"type":28,"text":29,"spans":30,"direction":26},"paragraph","Welcome to Evri's Privacy Notice. We are committed to protecting your personal information, and this notice explains how we handle your data.",[],{"type":28,"text":32,"spans":33,"direction":26},"This notice applies when you ask us to send an item, we are delivering something to you, or when we engage your services to deliver parcels to customers. It also outlines your privacy rights and how the law protects you. We will make it clear in this notice whether the information applies to customers, couriers, or both.",[],{"type":28,"text":35,"spans":36,"direction":26},"Our website and services are not meant for children, and we do not intentionally collect data related to children.",[],{"type":28,"text":38,"spans":39,"direction":26},"",[],{"type":41,"text":42,"spans":43,"direction":26},"heading2","Notice of change ",[],{"type":28,"text":45,"spans":46,"direction":26},"We wanted to let you know about some changes following our recent merger with DHL Ecommerce UK Limited, soon to be Evri Premium. ",[],{"type":28,"text":48,"spans":49,"direction":26},"As part of this merger, Evri Limited and DHL Ecommerce UK Limited are bringing together our operations, systems and data protection practices as part of the Evri Group. ",[],{"type":28,"text":51,"spans":52,"direction":26},"During this transition period, both organisations will act as Independent Data Controllers, who are working to align privacy, security and data management standards, so that your personal information continues to be handled safely and consistently across the two businesses.  ",[],{"type":28,"text":54,"spans":55,"direction":26},"Until this alignment is complete, your personal data may be processed by both Evri and Ecommerce UK Limited under their respective privacy frameworks. ",[],{"type":28,"text":57,"spans":58,"direction":26},"We are working closely to ensure that: ",[],{"type":60,"text":61,"spans":62,"direction":26},"list-item","Your personal data continues to only be used for the same purposes for which it was originally collected  ",[],{"type":60,"text":64,"spans":65,"direction":26},"Any updates to our processing activities are reflected in our privacy notices; and ",[],{"type":60,"text":67,"spans":68,"direction":26},"Your rights under the UK GDPR - such as access, or erasure - remain unaffected ",[],{"type":28,"text":70,"spans":71,"direction":26},"Once our privacy and operational practices are fully aligned, we will issue an updated privacy notice explaining how the two organisations manage your information. ",[],{"type":28,"text":73,"spans":74,"direction":26},"If you have any questions about how this merger affects your personal data, please contact the relevant team: ",[],{"type":28,"text":76,"spans":77,"direction":26},"Evri - Submit a data protection enquiry",[78,86],{"start":79,"end":80,"type":81,"data":82},7,39,"hyperlink",{"link_type":83,"url":84,"target":85},"Web","\u002Fdata-protection-form","_blank",{"start":79,"end":80,"type":87},"strong",{"type":28,"text":89,"spans":90,"direction":26},"DHL Ecommerce UK Limited - DataProtectionOfficer_ecsuk@dhl.com ",[],{"type":28,"text":38,"spans":92,"direction":26},[],{"type":41,"text":94,"spans":95,"direction":26},"Protecting Your Privacy",[],{"type":28,"text":97,"spans":98,"direction":26},"At Evri, we take your privacy seriously. We are fully dedicated to safeguarding your personal information.",[],{"type":28,"text":100,"spans":101,"direction":26},"The company responsible for your data is Evri Limited, registered with the ICO under number Z4921268. If you have any questions about how we protect your privacy, you can find our contact details at the end of this notice.",[102,105],{"start":103,"end":104,"type":87},41,53,{"start":106,"end":107,"type":87},92,100,{"type":28,"text":109,"spans":110,"direction":26},"We have a dedicated Data Protection Officer (DPO), Lee Howard, who oversees all matters related to privacy and this notice.",[111],{"start":112,"end":113,"type":87},20,49,{"type":28,"text":115,"spans":116,"direction":26},"It’s important to us that your information is accurate and up to date. Please let us know if your personal details change while you're using our services.",[],{"type":28,"text":38,"spans":118,"direction":26},[],{"type":41,"text":120,"spans":121,"direction":26},"Third-Party Links",[],{"type":28,"text":123,"spans":124,"direction":26},"Our website, mobile app, or communications may contain links to other websites, apps, or plugins. If you click on these, third parties may collect data about you. We don't control these sites and aren't responsible for their privacy practices. We recommend reading the privacy notice of any other sites you visit. ",[],{"type":28,"text":38,"spans":126,"direction":26},[],{"type":41,"text":128,"spans":129,"direction":26},"Customers",[],{"type":131,"text":132,"spans":133,"direction":26},"heading3","What Data We Collect on You",[],{"type":28,"text":135,"spans":136,"direction":26},"We may collect and use various types of personal data, which we group as follows:",[],{"type":60,"text":138,"spans":139,"direction":26},"Identity Data: Includes your name, username (email address and user ID), and title.",[140],{"start":141,"end":142,"type":87},0,13,{"type":60,"text":144,"spans":145,"direction":26},"Contact Data: Includes your billing and delivery address (including safe place locations), email, and phone numbers.",[146],{"start":141,"end":147,"type":87},12,{"type":60,"text":149,"spans":150,"direction":26},"Financial Data: Includes your bank account and payment card details.",[151],{"start":141,"end":152,"type":87},14,{"type":60,"text":154,"spans":155,"direction":26},"Transaction Data: Details of payments and purchases made with us.",[156],{"start":141,"end":157,"type":87},16,{"type":60,"text":159,"spans":160,"direction":26},"Technical Data: Includes information about your devices, like IP address, browser type, operating system, and location.",[161],{"start":141,"end":152,"type":87},{"type":60,"text":163,"spans":164,"direction":26},"Profile Data: Includes your username, password, purchase history, preferences, and responses to surveys.",[165],{"start":141,"end":147,"type":87},{"type":60,"text":167,"spans":168,"direction":26},"Usage Data: Includes how you use our website, app, and services.",[169],{"start":141,"end":170,"type":87},10,{"type":60,"text":172,"spans":173,"direction":26},"Marketing and Communications Data: Includes your preferences for receiving marketing and other communications from us.",[174],{"start":141,"end":175,"type":87},33,{"type":28,"text":177,"spans":178,"direction":26},"We do not collect any Special Categories of Personal Data (such as information about your race, religion, health, or political views) on our customers.",[179],{"start":180,"end":181,"type":87},22,57,{"type":28,"text":38,"spans":183,"direction":26},[],{"type":131,"text":185,"spans":186,"direction":26},"How We Use Your Information",[],{"type":28,"text":188,"spans":189,"direction":26},"We use your information in different ways depending on the type of data and our relationship with you. Below, you'll find details on how we use your data, why we use it, and the legal grounds for doing so.",[],"rich_text$48ed5aa8-bb97-4be0-825c-52825db31d5b","rich_text",null,{"variation":194,"version":17,"items":195,"primary":224,"id":230,"slice_type":231,"slice_label":192},"3ColumnTable",[196,200,203,207,210,214,217,220],{"Col1Content":197,"Col2Content":198,"Col3Content":199},"Register you as a new customer and create an account","We need your name, email address, and address to add you to our system","Processing is necessary for the performance of a contract",{"Col1Content":201,"Col2Content":202,"Col3Content":199},"Deliver your parcel or receive instruction to deliver a parcel","We need your name and address to collect and\u002For deliver your parcel",{"Col1Content":204,"Col2Content":205,"Col3Content":206},"Send you service messages by text and\u002For email","We use your phone number\u002Femail to send updates such as delivery notifications","Processing is necessary for Evri’s legitimate interests",{"Col1Content":208,"Col2Content":209,"Col3Content":206},"Parcel recipient satisfaction surveys","To improve our service quality",{"Col1Content":211,"Col2Content":212,"Col3Content":213},"Send you information about our products and services","To keep you updated with the latest offerings","You have given explicit consent, or processing is necessary for Evri’s legitimate interests",{"Col1Content":215,"Col2Content":216,"Col3Content":206},"Present content from the retailer who asked us to deliver an item to you","To display content such as product recommendations based on purchases you’ve made with them",{"Col1Content":218,"Col2Content":219,"Col3Content":206},"Fraud prevention and detection","To prevent fraud against you or Evri",{"Col1Content":221,"Col2Content":222,"Col3Content":223},"Capture your date of birth to perform age verification checks","To ensure compliant deliveries of age-restricted items","Processing is necessary to meet our legal obligations",{"SectionTitle":225,"SectionSubtitle":192,"Col1Header":226,"Col2Header":227,"Col3Header":228,"TableFooter":192,"isTableShort":229},"How we use your name and contact details","What We Do","Why We Do It","Lawful Basis for Processing",false,"information_table$3208caff-8223-4893-83f4-79d3a77519ef","information_table",{"variation":194,"version":17,"items":233,"primary":245,"id":247,"slice_type":231,"slice_label":192},[234,238,242],{"Col1Content":235,"Col2Content":236,"Col3Content":237},"Provide customer service and support","To ensure you receive the appropriate support for your enquiries","You have given consent, or Processing is necessary for the performance of a contract",{"Col1Content":239,"Col2Content":240,"Col3Content":241},"Train our staff","To ensure you get the best service when contacting us","Processing is necessary for Evri’s legitimate interest",{"Col1Content":243,"Col2Content":244,"Col3Content":206},"Ask you to leave a review or take a survey","To learn how customers use our products\u002Fservices",{"SectionTitle":246,"SectionSubtitle":192,"Col1Header":226,"Col2Header":227,"Col3Header":228,"TableFooter":192,"isTableShort":229},"How We Use Your Name and Contact Details (For Customer Service)","information_table$6964af1a-d50c-44f9-9d68-b101471ea61b",{"variation":194,"version":17,"items":249,"primary":258,"id":260,"slice_type":231,"slice_label":192},[250,254,255],{"Col1Content":251,"Col2Content":252,"Col3Content":253},"Take payment, give refunds, and settle claims","We need your financial details to process payments and facilitate refunds\u002Fclaims","You have given consent, or processing is necessary for the performance of a contract",{"Col1Content":218,"Col2Content":219,"Col3Content":206},{"Col1Content":256,"Col2Content":257,"Col3Content":206},"Collect and recover money owed to us","To complete the contract between us",{"SectionTitle":259,"SectionSubtitle":192,"Col1Header":226,"Col2Header":227,"Col3Header":228,"TableFooter":192,"isTableShort":229},"How We Use Your Financial Data","information_table$896106c6-e7ec-44df-84b4-0c88f42918d5",{"variation":194,"version":17,"items":262,"primary":266,"id":268,"slice_type":231,"slice_label":192},[263],{"Col1Content":264,"Col2Content":265,"Col3Content":206},"Improve our website and mobile app","To provide the best user experience and identify issues",{"SectionTitle":267,"SectionSubtitle":192,"Col1Header":226,"Col2Header":227,"Col3Header":228,"TableFooter":192,"isTableShort":229},"How We Use Your Usage Data","information_table$fe503bff-83cd-4f26-b51e-de2ec213dd96",{"variation":194,"version":17,"items":270,"primary":278,"id":280,"slice_type":231,"slice_label":192},[271,275],{"Col1Content":272,"Col2Content":273,"Col3Content":274},"Use data analytics to improve our website, products\u002Fservices, marketing, customer relationships, and experiences","To understand customer preferences, keep our site updated, and inform our marketing strategy","Processing is necessary for Evri's legitimate interests",{"Col1Content":276,"Col2Content":277,"Col3Content":274},"Administer and protect our business and website","To manage IT services, network security, and prevent fraud",{"SectionTitle":279,"SectionSubtitle":192,"Col1Header":226,"Col2Header":227,"Col3Header":228,"TableFooter":192,"isTableShort":229},"How We Use Technical Data","information_table$3122a650-5214-4a14-adf8-48b2ca36770d",{"variation":16,"version":17,"items":282,"primary":284,"id":414,"slice_type":191,"slice_label":192},[283],{},{"content":285},[286,289,291,294,297,300,305,310,315,318,320,323,328,331,336,339,342,345,347,350,359,362,365,368,371,381,386,388,391,394,397,400,403,405,408,411],{"type":28,"text":287,"spans":288,"direction":26},"We also anonymise and aggregate your personal information (so it no longer identifies you) and use it for purposes such as testing our IT systems, conducting research, analysing data, improving our website and app, ensuring quality and training, and developing new products and services.",[],{"type":28,"text":38,"spans":290,"direction":26},[],{"type":131,"text":292,"spans":293,"direction":26},"Sharing Your Information",[],{"type":28,"text":295,"spans":296,"direction":26},"We want to make it clear that we do not, and will not, sell your personal data (including your name, address, email, or phone number) to any third party. Earning and maintaining your trust is very important to us, and we believe this is key to doing so.",[],{"type":28,"text":298,"spans":299,"direction":26},"However, we may share your data with certain companies to provide our services to you, as described below:",[],{"type":60,"text":301,"spans":302,"direction":26},"Companies involved in getting your purchases to you: This includes payment service providers, warehouses, couriers, and in-country delivery companies for non-UK deliveries. ",[303],{"start":141,"end":304,"type":87},51,{"type":60,"text":306,"spans":307,"direction":26},"Professional service providers: This includes customs code determiners, digital marketing agencies and website hosts that help us manage our online business.",[308],{"start":141,"end":309,"type":87},30,{"type":60,"text":311,"spans":312,"direction":26},"HM Revenue & Customs, regulators, and other authorities: We may need to share data with authorities when required by law.",[313],{"start":141,"end":314,"type":87},55,{"type":28,"text":316,"spans":317,"direction":26},"We require all third-party partners to respect the security of your personal data and handle it according to the law. We do not allow them to use your data for their own purposes and only permit them to process it for the specific purposes we have outlined.",[],{"type":28,"text":38,"spans":319,"direction":26},[],{"type":131,"text":321,"spans":322,"direction":26},"IP Addresses",[],{"type":324,"text":325,"spans":326,"direction":26},"heading4","What Are IP Addresses?",[327],{"start":141,"end":180,"type":87},{"type":28,"text":329,"spans":330,"direction":26},"An IP address is a unique string of numbers that identifies a device (like your computer or smartphone) when it connects to the internet, allowing devices to communicate with each other.",[],{"type":324,"text":332,"spans":333,"direction":26},"How We Use IP Addresses",[334],{"start":141,"end":335,"type":87},23,{"type":60,"text":337,"spans":338,"direction":26},"We record the IP address of visitors to our website, along with related information such as the products viewed or searched for, the length of time spent on pages, and page interactions. ",[],{"type":60,"text":340,"spans":341,"direction":26},"An independent company helps us analyse this information to better understand how visitors use our site. ",[],{"type":60,"text":343,"spans":344,"direction":26},"We may then use this data to share information about our services with potential business customers. ",[],{"type":28,"text":38,"spans":346,"direction":26},[],{"type":131,"text":348,"spans":349,"direction":26},"Issuing Customer Surveys",[],{"type":28,"text":351,"spans":352,"direction":26},"To help us continually improve the quality of our services, we may invite you to participate in a survey conducted by a company called Verint. The survey is voluntary, and you can choose to complete it anonymously. If you provide any personal data, it will only be used if you choose to share it. The data collected by Verint is hosted in the United States, and transfers are protected by the European Commission's Standard Contractual Clauses.",[353,356],{"start":354,"end":355,"type":87},135,141,{"start":357,"end":358,"type":87},415,443,{"type":28,"text":360,"spans":361,"direction":26},"Only a small percentage of visitors will be asked to take the survey. If you don’t want to participate, simply close the pop-up invitation, and you can continue browsing without any issue.",[],{"type":28,"text":363,"spans":364,"direction":26},"If you choose to participate in the survey:",[],{"type":60,"text":366,"spans":367,"direction":26},"A session cookie will be placed on your device so that Verint can interact with you during the survey. This cookie will be deleted once you close your browser.",[],{"type":60,"text":369,"spans":370,"direction":26},"A persistent cookie will also be placed on your device to ensure you are not asked to take the survey again within a reasonable time. This cookie will be deleted at a set expiration date.",[],{"type":28,"text":372,"spans":373,"direction":26},"All survey data is submitted directly to Verint, and they will provide us with the survey results. Verint will not sell or disclose any personal data collected through the surveys to third parties. For more details on how Verint handles and processes survey data, please see their privacy policy.",[374,380],{"start":375,"end":376,"type":81,"data":377},281,295,{"link_type":83,"url":378,"target":379},"privacy-policy.html\u002F\u002Fwww.verint.com\u002Four-company\u002Flegal-documents\u002Fprivacy-policy\u002F","_new",{"start":375,"end":376,"type":87},{"type":28,"text":382,"spans":383,"direction":26},"Additionally, we may invite you to leave a review on Trustpilot. If you choose to participate, your email address will be shared with them solely for the purpose of sending the review invitation. You can opt not to respond to this invitation if you prefer. Trustpilot will retain your email address only for this purpose.",[384],{"start":104,"end":385,"type":87},63,{"type":28,"text":38,"spans":387,"direction":26},[],{"type":131,"text":389,"spans":390,"direction":26},"Data Retention",[],{"type":28,"text":392,"spans":393,"direction":26},"We will retain your personal information for as long as it is necessary for the purposes outlined in this privacy policy. We also keep records (which may include personal information) to meet legal, regulatory, tax, or accounting requirements. For instance, we are required to retain accurate records of our interactions with you to respond to any potential complaints or disputes.",[],{"type":28,"text":395,"spans":396,"direction":26},"If we believe there is a possibility of litigation, we may also retain certain records. The specific retention period for your personal information will depend on your relationship with us and why we hold your data.",[],{"type":28,"text":398,"spans":399,"direction":26},"To manage how long we keep your data, we follow a data retention policy that includes clear guidelines for retention and deletion.",[],{"type":28,"text":401,"spans":402,"direction":26},"In some cases, we may anonymise your personal data (making it untraceable back to you) for research or statistical purposes. If this happens, we may use this anonymised data indefinitely without further notice to you.",[],{"type":28,"text":38,"spans":404,"direction":26},[],{"type":131,"text":406,"spans":407,"direction":26},"Keeping Your Information",[],{"type":28,"text":409,"spans":410,"direction":26},"We will keep your personal information for as long as you have an account with us, or as long as necessary to provide the services you’ve requested. If you contact our Customer Care team, we may retain your information to help with support-related reporting and trend analysis.",[],{"type":28,"text":412,"spans":413,"direction":26},"If it's necessary or required by law or regulation, to resolve disputes, prevent fraud and abuse, or enforce our terms and conditions, we may retain some of your information even after you close your account, or it is no longer needed to provide services.",[],"rich_text$59b4cc40-3e47-4f6b-a263-2529d183e2f4",{"variation":16,"version":17,"items":416,"primary":418,"id":536,"slice_type":191,"slice_label":192},[417],{},{"content":419},[420,423,426,429,433,437,441,445,449,454,459,461,466,469,475,479,483,485,489,492,497,501,506,510,513,516,519,522,525,528,530,533],{"type":41,"text":421,"spans":422,"direction":26},"Couriers",[],{"type":131,"text":424,"spans":425,"direction":26},"The Data We Collect on You",[],{"type":28,"text":427,"spans":428,"direction":26},"We collect and process different types of personal data about you, categorised as follows:",[],{"type":60,"text":430,"spans":431,"direction":26},"Identity Data: Includes your first name, last name, courier ID (or similar identifier), photo, and title.",[432],{"start":141,"end":142,"type":87},{"type":60,"text":434,"spans":435,"direction":26},"Contact Data: Includes correspondence address, business address, email address, and telephone numbers.",[436],{"start":141,"end":147,"type":87},{"type":60,"text":438,"spans":439,"direction":26},"Financial Data: Includes bank account details for payment purposes.",[440],{"start":141,"end":152,"type":87},{"type":60,"text":442,"spans":443,"direction":26},"Technical Data: Includes internet protocol (IP) address, login data, browser type and version, time zone setting, browser plug-in types and versions, operating system and platform, and other technology on the devices you use to access Evri sites or courier applications.",[444],{"start":141,"end":152,"type":87},{"type":60,"text":446,"spans":447,"direction":26},"Usage Data: Includes information about how you use our website, courier application, products, and services.",[448],{"start":141,"end":170,"type":87},{"type":60,"text":450,"spans":451,"direction":26},"Criminal Conviction Data: Includes a record of criminal convictions, as provided by the Disclosure & Barring Service (DBS) or Disclosure Scotland Certificate.",[452],{"start":141,"end":453,"type":87},24,{"type":60,"text":455,"spans":456,"direction":26},"Driving Event (Telematics) Data: Includes data about your driving behaviour, such as speed and braking patterns.",[457],{"start":141,"end":458,"type":87},31,{"type":28,"text":38,"spans":460,"direction":26},[],{"type":131,"text":462,"spans":463,"direction":26},"Collection of Personal Data",[464],{"start":141,"end":465,"type":87},27,{"type":28,"text":467,"spans":468,"direction":26},"We process your personal data only when necessary. The grounds for processing are as follows:",[],{"type":470,"text":471,"spans":472,"direction":26},"o-list-item","Contractual Necessity: We process your personal data where necessary for the performance of a contract with you, or to take steps at your request before entering into a contract. For example, we need your information to pay you, manage your courier role, and provide you with benefits.",[473],{"start":141,"end":474,"type":87},21,{"type":470,"text":476,"spans":477,"direction":26},"Legal Obligation: We process your data when required to comply with legal obligations, such as tax or employment laws.",[478],{"start":141,"end":157,"type":87},{"type":470,"text":480,"spans":481,"direction":26},"Legitimate Interests: We process your data based on legitimate business interests, provided these are not overridden by your rights or interests in your personal data. Examples include monitoring and improving our services and preventing fraud.",[482],{"start":141,"end":112,"type":87},{"type":28,"text":38,"spans":484,"direction":26},[],{"type":131,"text":486,"spans":487,"direction":26},"Special Category Data",[488],{"start":141,"end":474,"type":87},{"type":28,"text":490,"spans":491,"direction":26},"Certain categories of personal data are considered sensitive and are subject to additional protections. Special category data includes data about your health, genetic or biometric data, sex life, sexual orientation, racial or ethnic origin, political opinions, religious beliefs, and trade union membership. For processing these categories, we rely on the following grounds:",[],{"type":60,"text":493,"spans":494,"direction":26},"Employment Law Obligations: We process this data to fulfil our obligations under employment law, such as ensuring workplace safety.",[495],{"start":141,"end":496,"type":87},26,{"type":60,"text":498,"spans":499,"direction":26},"Substantial Public Interest: Processing may be necessary for reasons of substantial public interest, such as preventing and detecting unlawful acts or ensuring equal opportunities.",[500],{"start":141,"end":465,"type":87},{"type":60,"text":502,"spans":503,"direction":26},"Protection of Life: Processing may be necessary to protect your life or that of another person in emergencies.",[504],{"start":141,"end":505,"type":87},18,{"type":60,"text":507,"spans":508,"direction":26},"Legal Claims: Processing is necessary for the establishment, exercise, or defence of legal claims.",[509],{"start":141,"end":147,"type":87},{"type":28,"text":511,"spans":512,"direction":26},"Evri may collect and process the following types of special category data:",[],{"type":60,"text":514,"spans":515,"direction":26},"Data related to absence for the purpose of managing attendance and absence procedures.",[],{"type":60,"text":517,"spans":518,"direction":26},"Information about your physical or mental health, medical condition, or disability status to ensure workplace safety and determine your fitness for work.",[],{"type":60,"text":520,"spans":521,"direction":26},"Details about your racial and ethnic origin, sexual orientation, religion or beliefs, and disability status to support equal opportunity monitoring and reporting.",[],{"type":28,"text":523,"spans":524,"direction":26},"In some cases, we may ask for your consent to process certain types of data. If consent is required, we will request it from you directly (either through a fair processing notice or otherwise) or from a third party acting on our behalf. We will clearly explain what we are asking your consent for.",[],{"type":28,"text":526,"spans":527,"direction":26},"Please note that agreeing to any such request is not a condition or requirement of your relationship with us. You are free to decline any request for consent without it affecting your relationship with Evri.",[],{"type":28,"text":38,"spans":529,"direction":26},[],{"type":131,"text":185,"spans":531,"direction":26},[532],{"start":141,"end":465,"type":87},{"type":28,"text":534,"spans":535,"direction":26},"We use your information in various ways, depending on the type of data we collect. Below, you'll find details on how we use your data, why we use it, and the legal grounds for doing so.",[],"rich_text$9b8945c2-4c43-496c-aa00-7ac9454d7af9",{"variation":194,"version":17,"items":538,"primary":567,"id":569,"slice_type":231,"slice_label":192},[539,543,546,549,552,555,557,561,564],{"Col1Content":540,"Col2Content":541,"Col3Content":542},"Register you in our courier systems","To add you to our job systems and allow you to receive job alerts","You have provided your consent, or processing is necessary for Evri’s legitimate interests",{"Col1Content":544,"Col2Content":545,"Col3Content":542},"Contact you about opportunities or your application","To keep you updated with available roles and\u002For your application status",{"Col1Content":547,"Col2Content":548,"Col3Content":199},"Register you as a courier","To add you to our systems",{"Col1Content":550,"Col2Content":551,"Col3Content":199},"Contact you via post, email, or text message to send service messages or correspondence","To manage and maintain our relationship with you",{"Col1Content":553,"Col2Content":554,"Col3Content":206},"To arrange and\u002For confirm appropriate insurance","To ensure adequate insurance coverage for courier duties",{"Col1Content":243,"Col2Content":556,"Col3Content":206},"To better understand your experience with Evri, to continually improve services",{"Col1Content":558,"Col2Content":559,"Col3Content":560},"Assess pension contributions and automate enrolment","To enable the ongoing assessment for automation into the pension scheme as well as calculating our contribution payable to the pension provider","Processing is necessary for Evri to comply with its legal obligations",{"Col1Content":562,"Col2Content":563,"Col3Content":206},"Personalisation of your courier profile","To enable better customer services by informing customers who will be delivering their parcel",{"Col1Content":565,"Col2Content":566,"Col3Content":206},"We provide necessary information to clients and law enforcement so they can take appropriate action if a crime, like parcel theft, is suspected","This helps ensure that any potential crime is investigated, and the right steps are taken to resolve the situation",{"SectionTitle":568,"SectionSubtitle":192,"Col1Header":226,"Col2Header":227,"Col3Header":228,"TableFooter":192,"isTableShort":229},"How We Use Your Name, Identity, and Contact Details","information_table$172e1f60-0015-4989-b6d3-ee64246b63df",{"variation":194,"version":17,"items":571,"primary":581,"id":582,"slice_type":231,"slice_label":192},[572,575,577],{"Col1Content":573,"Col2Content":574,"Col3Content":199},"Issue payments","To pay you for your work",{"Col1Content":218,"Col2Content":576,"Col3Content":206},"To prevent and detect fraud against either you or Evri",{"Col1Content":578,"Col2Content":579,"Col3Content":580},"Provide you with courier benefits","To enable you to access courier benefits and make the on-demand pay platform available","You have provided your consent, or processing is necessary for the performance of a contract",{"SectionTitle":259,"SectionSubtitle":192,"Col1Header":226,"Col2Header":227,"Col3Header":228,"TableFooter":192,"isTableShort":229},"information_table$187d87de-d3e3-4bc2-9204-5abef47af968",{"variation":194,"version":17,"items":584,"primary":590,"id":592,"slice_type":231,"slice_label":192},[585,588],{"Col1Content":586,"Col2Content":587,"Col3Content":580},"Provide support to our couriers","To ensure you receive appropriate assistance with any service enquiries you make",{"Col1Content":239,"Col2Content":589,"Col3Content":206},"To ensure we can provide you with the best possible service when you contact us",{"SectionTitle":591,"SectionSubtitle":192,"Col1Header":226,"Col2Header":227,"Col3Header":228,"TableFooter":192,"isTableShort":229},"How We Use Your Contact History With Us","information_table$2ce5bd30-eb89-49a1-9238-9dd2b91b9d97",{"variation":194,"version":17,"items":594,"primary":598,"id":600,"slice_type":231,"slice_label":192},[595],{"Col1Content":596,"Col2Content":597,"Col3Content":206},"We use information about your performance as a courier","To continually improve our service to clients and customers",{"SectionTitle":599,"SectionSubtitle":192,"Col1Header":226,"Col2Header":227,"Col3Header":228,"TableFooter":192,"isTableShort":229},"How We Use Performance Data","information_table$0f34c2bf-88a9-4553-918e-5b2231a01a3d",{"variation":194,"version":17,"items":602,"primary":611,"id":612,"slice_type":231,"slice_label":192},[603,605,608],{"Col1Content":272,"Col2Content":604,"Col3Content":206},"To define customer types for our products and services, to keep our website updated and relevant, and to inform our marketing strategy",{"Col1Content":606,"Col2Content":607,"Col3Content":206},"Administer and protect our business and website (including troubleshooting, data analysis, testing, system maintenance, support, reporting, and hosting data)","For running our business, providing administration and IT services, network security, and preventing fraud",{"Col1Content":609,"Col2Content":610,"Col3Content":206},"Collect information related to the type of mobile device being used when installing the courier application","To manage the ongoing provision of the courier application",{"SectionTitle":279,"SectionSubtitle":192,"Col1Header":226,"Col2Header":227,"Col3Header":228,"TableFooter":192,"isTableShort":229},"information_table$e9781c6f-867f-45e2-80ee-83b665750c34",{"variation":194,"version":17,"items":614,"primary":618,"id":620,"slice_type":231,"slice_label":192},[615],{"Col1Content":616,"Col2Content":617,"Col3Content":199},"Request criminal conviction data in the event of an incident involving theft or fraud against our business or to protect our customers","To support any investigation relating to incidents or tips from the public to protect you, our customers or Evri",{"SectionTitle":619,"SectionSubtitle":192,"Col1Header":226,"Col2Header":227,"Col3Header":228,"TableFooter":192,"isTableShort":229},"How We Use Criminal Conviction Data","information_table$8b6be64a-a9a8-45f0-a7d7-6067b1b91d68",{"variation":194,"version":17,"items":622,"primary":629,"id":631,"slice_type":231,"slice_label":192},[623,626],{"Col1Content":624,"Col2Content":625,"Col3Content":206},"Use telematics information collected from you to monitor driving statistics","To inform strategic decisions on our sustainability agenda",{"Col1Content":627,"Col2Content":628,"Col3Content":206},"Share anonymised data with the provider of our courier insurance product","To allow the insurance provider to monitor their risk associated with the provision of their policy",{"SectionTitle":630,"SectionSubtitle":192,"Col1Header":226,"Col2Header":227,"Col3Header":228,"TableFooter":192,"isTableShort":229},"How We Use Driving Event (Vehicle Telematics) Data","information_table$8f8a2331-436c-4e8a-ac0d-0c484f031752",{"variation":16,"version":17,"items":633,"primary":635,"id":774,"slice_type":191,"slice_label":192},[634],{},{"content":636},[637,642,645,647,651,657,662,667,672,676,680,683,685,687,690,693,698,702,706,710,714,718,721,723,727,730,733,736,739,742,744,748,751,755,761,765],{"type":131,"text":638,"spans":639,"direction":26},"Anonymisation and Aggregation of Data",[640],{"start":141,"end":641,"type":87},37,{"type":28,"text":643,"spans":644,"direction":26},"We may anonymise and aggregate personal data so that it no longer identifies you. This aggregated data is used for various purposes, including testing IT systems, conducting research, performing data analysis, improving our website and app, and developing new products and services.",[],{"type":28,"text":38,"spans":646,"direction":26},[],{"type":131,"text":648,"spans":649,"direction":26},"Cognito IQ Mobile\u002FCiQ Mobile App Installation & Usage",[650],{"start":141,"end":104,"type":87},{"type":28,"text":652,"spans":653,"direction":26},"The Cognito IQ Mobile\u002FCiQ Mobile App operates in a secure, sandboxed area on your device, ensuring it can only access specific functionalities that are essential for its operation, as controlled by the permissions granted by you. These permissions include:",[654],{"start":655,"end":656,"type":87},4,36,{"type":60,"text":658,"spans":659,"direction":26},"GPS: To enable location tracking for correct parcel delivery, but only when you are logged in.",[660],{"start":141,"end":661,"type":87},3,{"type":60,"text":663,"spans":664,"direction":26},"Camera: To take photos for safe place delivery and to scan barcodes on parcels.",[665],{"start":141,"end":666,"type":87},6,{"type":60,"text":668,"spans":669,"direction":26},"Audio: Required by the Cordova application framework, though the app does not utilise this functionality.",[670],{"start":141,"end":671,"type":87},5,{"type":60,"text":673,"spans":674,"direction":26},"Phone: To retrieve signal strength and network status information. The app will not make or monitor phone calls.",[675],{"start":141,"end":671,"type":87},{"type":60,"text":677,"spans":678,"direction":26},"System: To enable navigation software to download and store maps and temporarily store photos while being processed (never transferred to the device).",[679],{"start":141,"end":666,"type":87},{"type":28,"text":681,"spans":682,"direction":26},"Additionally, the mobile application does not access any files it has not created.",[],{"type":28,"text":38,"spans":684,"direction":26},[],{"type":131,"text":292,"spans":686,"direction":26},[],{"type":28,"text":688,"spans":689,"direction":26},"We do not sell any of your personal data to third parties, including your name, address, email, or phone number. We are committed to earning and maintaining your trust, which is essential for our operations.",[],{"type":28,"text":691,"spans":692,"direction":26},"However, we may share your data with the following categories of companies, strictly as necessary to provide our services:",[],{"type":60,"text":694,"spans":695,"direction":26},"Logistical service providers: Including companies managing handheld terminals, warehouses, and fleet management\u002Finsurance providers.",[696],{"start":141,"end":697,"type":87},28,{"type":60,"text":699,"spans":700,"direction":26},"Professional service providers: Including website hosts and companies that support our benefits or pension services, or Occupational Health Providers.",[701],{"start":141,"end":309,"type":87},{"type":60,"text":703,"spans":704,"direction":26},"HM Revenue & Customs: And other regulatory authorities or law enforcement agencies in the United Kingdom who require reporting of certain activities.",[705],{"start":141,"end":112,"type":87},{"type":60,"text":707,"spans":708,"direction":26},"Clients: In the event they need to bring civil claims against couriers for incidents such as parcel theft.",[709],{"start":141,"end":79,"type":87},{"type":60,"text":711,"spans":712,"direction":26},"Independent assurance providers: Including auditors and external legal representatives.",[713],{"start":141,"end":458,"type":87},{"type":60,"text":715,"spans":716,"direction":26},"Benefits providers: To enable you to access courier benefits and make the on-demand pay platform available (eg Onsi, Tipiar).",[717],{"start":141,"end":505,"type":87},{"type":28,"text":719,"spans":720,"direction":26},"We require all third parties to respect the security of your personal data and process it in compliance with applicable laws. We do not permit third-party service providers to use your personal data for their own purposes, and they may only process your data according to our instructions.",[],{"type":28,"text":38,"spans":722,"direction":26},[],{"type":131,"text":724,"spans":725,"direction":26},"How Long We Keep Your Data",[726],{"start":141,"end":496,"type":87},{"type":28,"text":728,"spans":729,"direction":26},"We will retain your personal data for as long as you are actively providing services as a courier for us, or for as long as it is necessary to provide the services to you.",[],{"type":28,"text":731,"spans":732,"direction":26},"If you cease providing services to us, we will retain your data for the duration necessary to meet our legal obligations, including for tax and accounting purposes. By law, we must keep basic information about our couriers (including Contact, Identity, Financial, and Transaction Data) for six years after you stop providing services, for tax and reporting requirements.",[],{"type":28,"text":734,"spans":735,"direction":26},"In certain situations, we may retain some of your information beyond this period, such as to resolve disputes, prevent fraud, or enforce our terms and conditions. Additionally, we may retain your data if it is necessary to comply with other legal or regulatory requirements.",[],{"type":28,"text":737,"spans":738,"direction":26},"If reasonably necessary, we may also retain your information to support legal claims or to ensure we can continue to provide assistance, such as for issues relating to deliveries or insurance.",[],{"type":28,"text":740,"spans":741,"direction":26},"Once your data is no longer required for these purposes, it will be securely deleted or anonymised.",[],{"type":28,"text":38,"spans":743,"direction":26},[],{"type":131,"text":745,"spans":746,"direction":26},"Recruitment process and AI use ",[747],{"start":141,"end":458,"type":87},{"type":470,"text":749,"spans":750,"direction":26},"We use AI tools to support parts of our recruitment process. These tools help us manage applications efficiently and fairly. Here’s what this means for you: ",[],{"type":60,"text":752,"spans":753,"direction":26},"Purpose of AI in Recruitment - AI is used to review basic information provided in application forms to assist with initial screening. This helps ensure applications are processed promptly and consistently. ",[754],{"start":141,"end":697,"type":87},{"type":60,"text":756,"spans":757,"direction":26},"Human Oversight - AI does not make final hiring decisions. All applications are ultimately reviewed by a hiring manager or a member of the recruitment team before any decision is made. ",[758,759],{"start":141,"end":505,"type":87},{"start":496,"end":760,"type":87},29,{"type":60,"text":762,"spans":763,"direction":26},"Data Protection - Your personal data is processed in line with data protection laws and our internal policies. AI systems operate within a secure environment, and your data is not used to train AI models. ",[764],{"start":141,"end":505,"type":87},{"type":60,"text":766,"spans":767,"direction":26},"Your Rights - You have the right to object to the use of AI in processing your application. If you wish to exercise this right or have questions about how your data is used, please enquire with our team",[768,769,773],{"start":141,"end":152,"type":87},{"start":770,"end":771,"type":81,"data":772},181,202,{"link_type":83,"url":84,"target":85},{"start":770,"end":771,"type":87},"rich_text$28316204-4b66-47a4-a288-c7303c84afb4",{"variation":16,"version":17,"items":776,"primary":778,"id":919,"slice_type":191,"slice_label":192},[777],{},{"content":779},[780,783,786,795,797,800,803,806,814,818,821,825,830,833,838,841,843,846,849,852,854,857,860,864,868,872,876,880,884,888,892,895,898,900,903,906,910,914,917],{"type":41,"text":781,"spans":782,"direction":26},"All users",[],{"type":131,"text":784,"spans":785,"direction":26},"Cookies",[],{"type":28,"text":787,"spans":788,"direction":26},"For information on how we use cookies at Evri, please see our Cookie Policy at https:\u002F\u002Fwww.evri.com\u002Fcookie-policy",[789,794],{"start":790,"end":791,"type":81,"data":792},79,113,{"link_type":83,"url":793,"target":85},"privacy-policy.html\u002F\u002Fwww.evri.com\u002Fcookie-policy",{"start":790,"end":791,"type":87},{"type":28,"text":38,"spans":796,"direction":26},[],{"type":131,"text":798,"spans":799,"direction":26},"Cross-Border Transfers",[],{"type":28,"text":801,"spans":802,"direction":26},"Where permitted by law, we may transfer your personal data to countries within the European Economic Area (EEA). The safeguards in place for data transfers within the UK are deemed sufficient by the European Commission, so we don’t need additional controls.",[],{"type":28,"text":804,"spans":805,"direction":26},"In certain cases, we may also transfer your personal data to countries outside the EEA, which may not offer the same level of data protection as the UK. These transfers will be necessary to perform our contract with you or for the other purposes outlined in this notice.",[],{"type":28,"text":807,"spans":808,"direction":26},"To ensure your data is protected when transferred outside the EEA, Evri has implemented safeguards such as standard contractual clauses or supplementary measures to secure the transfer of your data to those countries.",[809,811],{"start":810,"end":354,"type":87},107,{"start":812,"end":813,"type":87},139,161,{"type":28,"text":815,"spans":816,"direction":26},"Artificial Intelligence (AI) and Your Personal Data",[817],{"start":141,"end":304,"type":87},{"type":28,"text":819,"spans":820,"direction":26},"We are committed to protecting your privacy and ensuring the responsible use of AI technologies. Please note the following regarding our use of AI:",[],{"type":470,"text":822,"spans":823,"direction":26},"Special Category Data: We do not authorise the use of special category data within generative AI systems. This includes sensitive information such as racial or ethnic origin, political opinions, religious or philosophical beliefs, trade union membership, genetic data, biometric data, health data, and data concerning a person's sex life or sexual orientation.",[824],{"start":141,"end":180,"type":87},{"type":470,"text":826,"spans":827,"direction":26},"Personal Data: Personal data may be utilised within generative AI systems. However, it is processed within a protective AI environment designed to safeguard your information. Importantly, this data is not used to train the AI model, ensuring that your personal information remains secure and confidential. We recommend, where possible, that personal data is not used. If processing personal data is necessary, it will be limited to the purpose it is aiming to achieve.",[828],{"start":141,"end":829,"type":87},15,{"type":470,"text":831,"spans":832,"direction":26},"We use AI technology to help identify photos that do not meet our standards. This supports our commitment to maintaining compliance. ",[],{"type":60,"text":834,"spans":835,"direction":26},"Safe place photos should not contain any personal data (such as identifiable individuals or sensitive information). If any photo does include personal data, our AI system is designed to detect and remove these images from processing to protect privacy. ",[836],{"start":837,"end":697,"type":87},25,{"type":60,"text":839,"spans":840,"direction":26},"The AI is used solely to check compliance with safe place requirements and to prevent the use of images that contain personal data. ",[],{"type":28,"text":38,"spans":842,"direction":26},[],{"type":131,"text":844,"spans":845,"direction":26},"Data Security",[],{"type":28,"text":847,"spans":848,"direction":26},"We take the security of your personal data seriously and have implemented appropriate measures to prevent it from being accidentally lost, accessed without authorisation, or misused. We limit access to your personal data to only those employees, agents, contractors, and third parties who need it for business purposes. They will only process your data based on our instructions and are obligated to keep it confidential.",[],{"type":28,"text":850,"spans":851,"direction":26},"In the event of a suspected data breach, we have procedures in place to address it. If required by law, we will notify you and the relevant authorities of any breach.",[],{"type":28,"text":38,"spans":853,"direction":26},[],{"type":131,"text":855,"spans":856,"direction":26},"Your Legal Rights",[],{"type":28,"text":858,"spans":859,"direction":26},"You have several rights regarding your personal data. These include:",[],{"type":60,"text":861,"spans":862,"direction":26},"Request Access: You have the right to access the personal information we hold about you, enabling you to receive a copy and check that we are processing it lawfully.",[863],{"start":141,"end":152,"type":87},{"type":60,"text":865,"spans":866,"direction":26},"Request Correction: You can request that we correct any inaccurate personal data we hold about you. You can also update most of this information through your account.",[867],{"start":141,"end":505,"type":87},{"type":60,"text":869,"spans":870,"direction":26},"Request Deletion: You have the right to request that we delete or stop processing your data in certain circumstances, especially if we no longer have a valid reason to process it. We may not always be able to fulfil your request for deletion if we need to retain the data for legal reasons, but we will inform you if this applies.",[871],{"start":141,"end":157,"type":87},{"type":60,"text":873,"spans":874,"direction":26},"Request Transfer: You can request that we transfer your data to you or another service provider in a structured, commonly used, and machine-readable format. This applies to data we process based on your consent or when fulfilling a contract with you.",[875],{"start":141,"end":157,"type":87},{"type":60,"text":877,"spans":878,"direction":26},"Object to Processing: If we are processing your data based on legitimate interests (or those of a third party), you can object if you feel it impacts your rights and freedoms. In some cases, we may demonstrate that our legitimate interests outweigh your rights.",[879],{"start":141,"end":112,"type":87},{"type":60,"text":881,"spans":882,"direction":26},"Request Restriction of Processing: You can ask us to suspend the processing of your personal data in certain situations, such as:\n- If you want us to verify the accuracy of the data. \n- If you believe the data is being processed unlawfully but don’t want it deleted.\n- If you need the data for legal claims even if we no longer need it. \n- If you’ve objected to our use of the data and we need to verify whether we have overriding grounds to continue using it.",[883],{"start":141,"end":175,"type":87},{"type":60,"text":885,"spans":886,"direction":26},"Withdraw Consent: If we are processing your personal data based on your consent, you can withdraw it at any time. This will not affect the lawfulness of any processing before you withdrew your consent. Please note that if you withdraw your consent, we may not be able to provide certain products or services to you, and we will inform you if that’s the case.",[887],{"start":141,"end":157,"type":87},{"type":60,"text":889,"spans":890,"direction":26},"Direct Marketing: If you receive direct marketing from us, you can withdraw your consent via the ‘Unsubscribe’ link in the email or through your account settings.",[891],{"start":141,"end":157,"type":87},{"type":28,"text":893,"spans":894,"direction":26},"You will not typically have to pay a fee to access your personal data or to exercise any of the rights listed above. However, if your request is clearly unfounded, repetitive, or excessive, we may charge a reasonable fee or refuse to comply with your request.",[],{"type":28,"text":896,"spans":897,"direction":26},"To process your request, we may need to verify your identity to ensure that personal data is not disclosed to anyone who shouldn’t have access to it. We may also contact you for additional information to help speed up our response.",[],{"type":28,"text":38,"spans":899,"direction":26},[],{"type":131,"text":901,"spans":902,"direction":26},"Contacting Us",[],{"type":28,"text":904,"spans":905,"direction":26},"If you have any questions about this privacy notice, wish to exercise your legal rights, or make a complaint about how we're processing your personal data, you can contact us by:",[],{"type":60,"text":907,"spans":908,"direction":26},"Enquiry form: Choose the enquiry form below that best matches your request",[909],{"start":141,"end":142,"type":87},{"type":60,"text":911,"spans":912,"direction":26},"Mail: You can also write to us at:",[913],{"start":141,"end":671,"type":87},{"type":28,"text":915,"spans":916,"direction":26},"Data Protection Team\nEvri\nCapitol House\n1 Capitol Close\nMorley\nLeeds\nLS27 0WH",[],{"type":28,"text":38,"spans":918,"direction":26},[],"rich_text$a832f37d-e85f-423d-acc9-46ae93959e0f",{"variation":16,"version":17,"items":921,"primary":1078,"id":1080,"slice_type":1081,"slice_label":192},[922,936,950,963,975,988,1012,1024,1040,1062],{"questionTitle":923,"questionBody":924},"Request Access",[925,928],{"type":28,"text":926,"spans":927,"direction":26},"You have the right to access the personal information we hold about you, enabling you to receive a copy and check that we are processing it lawfully. ",[],{"type":28,"text":929,"spans":930,"direction":26},"Request access to my personal data",[931,935],{"start":141,"end":932,"type":81,"data":933},34,{"link_type":83,"url":934,"target":85},"\u002Fdsar-form",{"start":141,"end":932,"type":87},{"questionTitle":937,"questionBody":938},"Request Correction",[939,942],{"type":28,"text":940,"spans":941,"direction":26},"You can request that we correct any inaccurate personal data we hold about you. You can also update most of this information through your account. ",[],{"type":28,"text":943,"spans":944,"direction":26},"Request a correction to my personal data",[945,949],{"start":141,"end":946,"type":81,"data":947},40,{"link_type":83,"url":948,"target":85},"\u002Fcorrect-personal-data-form",{"start":141,"end":946,"type":87},{"questionTitle":951,"questionBody":952},"Request Deletion",[953,956],{"type":28,"text":954,"spans":955,"direction":26},"You have the right to request that we delete or stop processing your data in certain circumstances, especially if we no longer have a valid reason to process it. We may not always be able to fulfil your request for deletion if we need to retain the data for legal reasons, but we will inform you if this applies.",[],{"type":28,"text":957,"spans":958,"direction":26},"Request deletion of my personal data",[959,962],{"start":141,"end":656,"type":81,"data":960},{"link_type":83,"url":961,"target":85},"\u002Fdelete-personal-data-form ",{"start":141,"end":656,"type":87},{"questionTitle":964,"questionBody":965},"Request Transfer",[966,969],{"type":28,"text":967,"spans":968,"direction":26},"You can request that we transfer your data to you or another service provider in a structured, commonly used, and machine-readable format. This applies to data we process based on your consent or when fulfilling a contract with you.",[],{"type":28,"text":970,"spans":971,"direction":26},"Request a data transfer",[972,974],{"start":141,"end":335,"type":81,"data":973},{"link_type":83,"url":84,"target":85},{"start":141,"end":335,"type":87},{"questionTitle":976,"questionBody":977},"Object to Processing",[978,981],{"type":28,"text":979,"spans":980,"direction":26},"If we are processing your data based on legitimate interests (or those of a third party), you can object if you feel it impacts your rights and freedoms. In some cases, we may demonstrate that our legitimate interests outweigh your rights.",[],{"type":28,"text":982,"spans":983,"direction":26},"Object to the use of my data",[984,987],{"start":141,"end":697,"type":81,"data":985},{"link_type":83,"url":986,"target":85},"\u002Fobject-to-data-processing-form",{"start":141,"end":697,"type":87},{"questionTitle":989,"questionBody":990},"Request Restriction of Processing",[991,994,997,1000,1003,1006],{"type":28,"text":992,"spans":993,"direction":26},"You can ask us to suspend the processing of your personal data in certain situations, such as:",[],{"type":60,"text":995,"spans":996,"direction":26},"If you want us to verify the accuracy of the data. ",[],{"type":60,"text":998,"spans":999,"direction":26},"If you believe the data is being processed unlawfully but don’t want it deleted.",[],{"type":60,"text":1001,"spans":1002,"direction":26},"If you need the data for legal claims even if we no longer need it. ",[],{"type":60,"text":1004,"spans":1005,"direction":26},"If you’ve objected to our use of the data and we need to verify whether we have overriding grounds to continue using it.",[],{"type":28,"text":1007,"spans":1008,"direction":26},"Restrict the use of my data",[1009,1011],{"start":141,"end":465,"type":81,"data":1010},{"link_type":83,"url":986,"target":85},{"start":141,"end":465,"type":87},{"questionTitle":1013,"questionBody":1014},"Withdraw Consent",[1015,1018],{"type":28,"text":1016,"spans":1017,"direction":26},"If we are processing your personal data based on your consent, you can withdraw it at any time. This will not affect the lawfulness of any processing before you withdrew your consent. Please note that if you withdraw your consent, we may not be able to provide certain products or services to you, and we will inform you if that’s the case.",[],{"type":28,"text":1019,"spans":1020,"direction":26},"Request to withdraw consent",[1021,1023],{"start":141,"end":465,"type":81,"data":1022},{"link_type":83,"url":84,"target":85},{"start":141,"end":465,"type":87},{"questionTitle":1025,"questionBody":1026},"Report a Suspected Personal Data Breach",[1027,1030,1033],{"type":28,"text":1028,"spans":1029,"direction":26},"If you believe personal data has been lost, accessed without permission, or shared in error, please let us know as soon as possible.",[],{"type":28,"text":1031,"spans":1032,"direction":26},"Our team will review the information you provide and investigate the issue in line with our data protection procedures.",[],{"type":28,"text":1034,"spans":1035,"direction":26},"Report a personal data breach",[1036,1039],{"start":141,"end":760,"type":81,"data":1037},{"link_type":83,"url":1038,"target":85},"\u002Fpdb-form",{"start":141,"end":760,"type":87},{"questionTitle":1041,"questionBody":1042},"Personal Data Disclosure Request (Authorities Only)",[1043,1046,1054,1056],{"type":28,"text":1044,"spans":1045,"direction":26},"If you are a law enforcement agency, regulatory authority, or government body requesting disclosure of personal data, please submit your request using the form below.",[],{"type":28,"text":1047,"spans":1048,"direction":26},"Submit an official data disclosure request",[1049,1053],{"start":141,"end":1050,"type":81,"data":1051},42,{"link_type":83,"url":1052,"target":85},"\u002Fdisclosure-form",{"start":141,"end":1050,"type":87},{"type":28,"text":38,"spans":1055,"direction":26},[],{"type":28,"text":1057,"spans":1058,"direction":26},"Please note: All requests must send a signed Data Protection Act (DPA) form to our team.",[1059],{"start":1060,"end":1061,"type":87},38,75,{"questionTitle":1063,"questionBody":1064},"Have a question about your personal data?",[1065,1068,1071],{"type":28,"text":1066,"spans":1067,"direction":26},"For any data protection enquiries that are not covered by the specific request forms above, please use the general enquiry form below.",[],{"type":28,"text":1069,"spans":1070,"direction":26},"This includes questions about our privacy notice, personal data processing, or recent privacy-related updates.",[],{"type":28,"text":1072,"spans":1073,"direction":26},"Submit an enquiry",[1074,1077],{"start":141,"end":1075,"type":81,"data":1076},17,{"link_type":83,"url":84,"target":85},{"start":141,"end":1075,"type":87},{"title":1079},"Contact our Data Protection team","frequently_asked_questions$36fc7b89-8ea1-4de3-b08a-42144088989b","frequently_asked_questions",{"variation":16,"version":17,"items":1083,"primary":1119,"id":1121,"slice_type":1081,"slice_label":192},[1084],{"questionTitle":1085,"questionBody":1086},"Submit a complaint about data protection \u002F how Evri uses personal data",[1087,1090,1097,1099,1102,1104,1106],{"type":28,"text":1088,"spans":1089,"direction":26},"If you're unhappy with how we collect or use your personal data, you can file a complaint with us through our contact form:",[],{"type":28,"text":1091,"spans":1092,"direction":26},"Submit a data protection complaint",[1093,1096],{"start":141,"end":932,"type":81,"data":1094},{"link_type":83,"url":1095,"target":85},"\u002Fdata-protection-complaint-form",{"start":141,"end":932,"type":87},{"type":28,"text":38,"spans":1098,"direction":26},[],{"type":28,"text":1100,"spans":1101,"direction":26},"You can also send your complaint by regular mail to the following address:",[],{"type":28,"text":915,"spans":1103,"direction":26},[],{"type":28,"text":38,"spans":1105,"direction":26},[],{"type":28,"text":1107,"spans":1108,"direction":26},"You have the right to complain to the Information Commissioner’s Office (ICO), the UK’s data protection authority. You can find more information on their website at www.ico.org.uk. Our ICO registration number is Z4921268.",[1109,1111,1116],{"start":1060,"end":1110,"type":87},77,{"start":1112,"end":1113,"type":81,"data":1114},165,179,{"link_type":83,"url":1115,"target":379},"privacy-policy.html\u002F\u002Fwww.ico.org.uk",{"start":1117,"end":1118,"type":87},212,220,{"title":1120},"Complaints","frequently_asked_questions$4728c006-951a-44ab-82ac-dd33fa595a12",{"variation":16,"version":17,"items":1123,"primary":1124,"id":1138,"slice_type":191,"slice_label":192},[],{"content":1125},[1126,1128,1130,1133,1135],{"type":28,"text":38,"spans":1127,"direction":26},[],{"type":28,"text":38,"spans":1129,"direction":26},[],{"type":28,"text":1131,"spans":1132,"direction":26},"We aim to respond to all legitimate requests within one month. If your request is complex or if you've made multiple requests, it might take us longer, but we will notify you and keep you updated.",[],{"type":28,"text":38,"spans":1134,"direction":26},[],{"type":28,"text":1136,"spans":1137,"direction":26},"This notice was last updated in November 2025.",[],"rich_text$c030be04-2823-41e7-b2b5-485667f53e4a",[15,193,232,248,261,269,281,415,537,570,583,593,601,613,621,632,775,920,1082,1122],["Reactive",1141],{"$sglobal-feature-switches":1142,"$sclients":1209,"$sglobal-basket-count":192},{"abtasty":1143,"accessibe":1147,"appPromoBanner":1150,"autoDivertUpdates":1153,"awin":1156,"bulkInternational":1159,"bulkSendEnabled":1162,"businessAccountForm75Enabled":1165,"enableBasketCount":1168,"enableBulkPhaseTwo":1171,"euCustomsDuty":1174,"groovyAdvert":1177,"newInternationalSendFlow":1180,"newinternationalpages":1187,"oohPreferenceFlag":1191,"opente